$ Duck — 8x9 nonogram from Rosetta Code
$ https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Nonogram_solver
$
$ Solution:
$   .#...##..
$   ###...#..
$   #.#####..
$   #######.#
$   ....#####
$   ....###..
$   ..####...
$   ..###....

letting height be 8
letting width be 9
letting maxruns be 2

letting row_clues be
    [[ 1, 2],
     [ 3, 1],
     [ 1, 5],
     [ 7, 1],
     [ 5, 0],
     [ 3, 0],
     [ 4, 0],
     [ 3, 0]]

letting col_clues be
    [[ 3, 0],
     [ 2, 1],
     [ 3, 2],
     [ 2, 2],
     [ 6, 0],
     [ 1, 5],
     [ 6, 0],
     [ 1, 0],
     [ 2, 0]]
